{title: Meri Duniya Me Aake}
{artist: Tum Bin Sonu Nigam Chithra}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] [G],        Meri duniya mein aake
[A] [Em],        mat jaa Mat jaa,
[A] [Bm],        kahin mat jaa
[G] [A],        Meri duniya mein aake
[Bm] [Bm] [Bm],        mat jaa, mat jaa, mat jaa
[Bm],        Kya maine paa liya hai
[G] [Bm],        Kya maine kho diya hai
[Bm],        Shaayad yeh sochkar hi
[G] [Bm],        Dil aaj ro diya hai
[Bm] [G],        Tu hi to tha mera apna
[Bm] [G],        Kaise phir yeh toota sapna
[Bm] [G],        Tu jo milke kho jaayega
[Bm] [G],        Jeena mushkil ho jaayega
[Bm] [G],        OO..Meri duniya mein aake...
[Bm],        Yeh ishq ki hain raahein
[G] [Bm],        Main jinpe chal raha hoon
[Bm],        Is aag mein na jaane
[G] [Bm],        Kab se main jal raha hoon
[Bm] [G],        Main to hoon tera deewana
[Bm] [G],        Tune mujhko na pehchaana
[Bm] [G],        Dilbar mere aisa na kar
[Bm] [G],        Chaahat mein tu ruswaa na kar
[Bm] [G],        OOO.. Meri duniya mein aake
